eator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134885181,imgsize-1414309.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Just 15 ml of olive oil before carbs may lower blood sugar spikes, mouse study suggests]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134885560.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Frank Lloyd Wright-designed planetarium at Florida Southern College in Lakeland has reopened after more than 20 years of limited use. The historic facility, whose projection system stopped working in 2004, has been restored with modern projection and sound technology. It will now offer public astronomy shows, school visits and educational programmes four days a week.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/eating-only-15-ml-olive-oil-before-having-carbs-can-have-a-positive-impact-on-blood-sugar-spike-in-an-experiment-on-mice-scientists-are-tracing-the-effect-to-a-combination-of-digestive-hormones-and-nerve-signals/articleshow/134885560.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/eating-only-15-ml-olive-oil-before-having-carbs-can-have-a-positive-impact-on-blood-sugar-spike-in-an-experiment-on-mice-scientists-are-tracing-the-effect-to-a-combination-of-digestive-hormones-and-nerve-signals/articleshow/134885560.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T13:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134885983,imgsize-122398.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A 2,300-year-old shipwreck off Croatia’s Vis island reveals rare pottery, personal belongings and wooden remains]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134883476.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A significant shipwreck has been discovered off the Croatian island of Vis, containing artifacts from the Hellenistic period. Archaeologists recovered various objects, including pottery, wooden remains, and personal items from the merchant vessel. The findings date back approximately 2,300 years, shedding light on ancient maritime commerce. Unique discoveries include drinking vessels, a coin from ancient Pharos, and parts of the ship's wooden structure.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/archaeology/a-2300-year-old-shipwreck-off-croatias-vis-island-has-yielded-rare-pottery-personal-belongings-and-surviving-wooden-remains-offering-a-glimpse-into-merchant-sailing-during-the-hellenistic-period/articleshow/134883476.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/archaeology/a-2300-year-old-shipwreck-off-croatias-vis-island-has-yielded-rare-pottery-personal-belongings-and-surviving-wooden-remains-offering-a-glimpse-into-merchant-sailing-during-the-hellenistic-period/articleshow/134883476.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T13:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134883602,imgsize-1426666.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[How Francis Ford Coppola turned an abandoned Belize hunting lodge into a 20-room resort]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134884840.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In 1981, filmmaker Francis Ford Coppola bought an abandoned hunting lodge in the forests of Belize and turned it into a private family retreat. Twelve years later, it opened as Blancaneaux Lodge, a 20-room resort. The property has retained much of its original character, with cottages, wooden interiors and outdoor activities including kayaking, horse riding and swimming near waterfalls.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-1981-francis-ford-coppola-found-an-abandoned-belize-jungle-lodge-and-turned-it-into-a-family-retreat-12-years-later-blancaneaux-opened-as-a-20-room-resort-now-drawing-about-85-of-its-power-from-a-creek/articleshow/134884840.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-1981-francis-ford-coppola-found-an-abandoned-belize-jungle-lodge-and-turned-it-into-a-family-retreat-12-years-later-blancaneaux-opened-as-a-20-room-resort-now-drawing-about-85-of-its-power-from-a-creek/articleshow/134884840.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T12:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134885425,imgsize-156290.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Demi Moore and Ashton Kutcher visited a Kenyan sanctuary for orphaned elephants]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134884342.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/demi-moore-and-ashton-kutcher-once-visited-a-kenyan-elephant-sanctuary-where-orphaned-calves-were-being-raised-for-the-wild-amid-drought-and-poaching-threats/articleshow/134884342.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/demi-moore-and-ashton-kutcher-once-visited-a-kenyan-elephant-sanctuary-where-orphaned-calves-were-being-raised-for-the-wild-amid-drought-and-poaching-threats/articleshow/134884342.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T13:45:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134884626,imgsize-149448.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Historic San Francisco church condo sells for $6.65M, $150K below asking price]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134875271.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/a-historic-san-francisco-church-was-converted-into-luxury-residences-and-one-three-bedroom-home-inside-the-landmark-has-now-sold-for-6-65-million-about-150000-below-its-asking-price/articleshow/134875271.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/a-historic-san-francisco-church-was-converted-into-luxury-residences-and-one-three-bedroom-home-inside-the-landmark-has-now-sold-for-6-65-million-about-150000-below-its-asking-price/articleshow/134875271.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T12:05:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134875300,imgsize-563311.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kevin Durant’s $10M pledge helps 200+ students yearly, with 96% college acceptance rate]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134876030.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Kevin Durant has committed $10 million to help students access higher education in his Maryland community. This initiative supports over 200 students each year, with a college acceptance rate exceeding 96%. The Durant Center, opened in January 2019, provides resources for students from underserved backgrounds. College Track assists participants from ninth grade through college to overcome barriers. Durant's foundation aims to positively impact local youth by enhancing their educational opportunities.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2018-kevin-durant-pledged-10-million-over-10-years-to-create-a-college-access-center-in-his-maryland-hometown-today-it-serves-200-students-a-year-and-reports-a-96-four-year-college-acceptance-rate/articleshow/134876030.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2018-kevin-durant-pledged-10-million-over-10-years-to-create-a-college-access-center-in-his-maryland-hometown-today-it-serves-200-students-a-year-and-reports-a-96-four-year-college-acceptance-rate/articleshow/134876030.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T12:04:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134876072,imgsize-56818.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Only 40 Bottles Made: Macallan 1926 Whisky Sells for £2.125 Million]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134884779.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/a-bottle-of-macallan-1926-whisky-sold-for-2-125-million-only-40-bottles-came-from-the-original-cask-after-60-years-of-maturation/articleshow/134884779.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/a-bottle-of-macallan-1926-whisky-sold-for-2-125-million-only-40-bottles-came-from-the-original-cask-after-60-years-of-maturation/articleshow/134884779.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T13:15:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134884821,imgsize-89490.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[George Clooney’s French estate has vineyards as he plans an Italian restaurant]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134883693.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/george-clooneys-425-acre-french-estate-has-vineyards-and-olive-groves-he-now-plans-an-italian-restaurant-nearby/articleshow/134883693.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/george-clooneys-425-acre-french-estate-has-vineyards-and-olive-groves-he-now-plans-an-italian-restaurant-nearby/articleshow/134883693.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T11:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134883806,imgsize-157940.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Michigan couple loses claim to 50-foot land strip after neighbour commissions two surveys]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134870098.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Michigan couple has lost a legal battle over a 50-foot-wide strip of land they claimed was wrongly excluded from their property because of an error in a 1965 deed. The couple, who bought their land at a 2015 tax sale, argued that previous owners had used the disputed area for decades. However, two surveys placed the land within their neighbour's property. On October 9, 2026, the Michigan Court of Appeals ruled against the couple, citing insufficient evidence to establish ownership.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-michigan-couple-bought-land-at-a-2015-tax-sale-and-claimed-a-50-foot-strip-lost-through-a-1965-deed-error-after-two-surveys-put-it-with-their-neighbour-an-appeals-court-ruled-against-them/articleshow/134870098.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-michigan-couple-bought-land-at-a-2015-tax-sale-and-claimed-a-50-foot-strip-lost-through-a-1965-deed-error-after-two-surveys-put-it-with-their-neighbour-an-appeals-court-ruled-against-them/articleshow/134870098.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T11:04:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134870425,imgsize-274248.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Tyler Perry donated $750K to clear property tax debt for 300+ Atlanta seniors]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134877149.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Tyler Perry has made a significant donation of $750,000 to assist low-income senior citizens in Atlanta. This contribution will help more than 300 seniors pay overdue property taxes and remain in their homes. Additionally, it will support a pilot program for another 100 seniors facing property tax increases. Mayor Dickens emphasized the importance of preserving the homes of longstanding residents amid Atlanta's growth.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1992-tyler-perry-put-his-12000-savings-into-a-failed-atlanta-play-and-later-spent-months-living-in-a-car-decades-later-his-750000-gift-helped-pay-back-taxes-for-300-seniors-and-freeze-taxes-for-100-more/articleshow/134877149.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1992-tyler-perry-put-his-12000-savings-into-a-failed-atlanta-play-and-later-spent-months-living-in-a-car-decades-later-his-750000-gift-helped-pay-back-taxes-for-300-seniors-and-freeze-taxes-for-100-more/articleshow/134877149.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T11:03:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134877158,imgsize-877612.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[University of Glasgow develops £20 ultrasound device to produce fertiliser from air and water]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134883471.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Researchers at the University of Glasgow have developed an affordable ultrasound device to produce nitrate for agriculture. This device uses sound waves, air, and water to create nitrate without industrial production reliance. While current experiments show potential, energy consumption remains high compared to the Haber-Bosch process. The team plans to refine the design over the next year for practical agricultural use.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/university-of-glasgow-develops-20-ultrasound-device-to-produce-fertiliser-from-air-and-water-aiming-to-help-farmers-in-remote-areas/articleshow/134883471.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/university-of-glasgow-develops-20-ultrasound-device-to-produce-fertiliser-from-air-and-water-aiming-to-help-farmers-in-remote-areas/articleshow/134883471.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T10:57:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134883604,imgsize-112324.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Why did Pakistan declare Emergency in Imran Khan's bastion Khyber Pakhtunkhwa]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134883270.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/why-did-pakistan-declare-emergency-in-imran-khans-bastion-khyber-pakhtunkhwa/articleshow/134883270.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/why-did-pakistan-declare-emergency-in-imran-khans-bastion-khyber-pakhtunkhwa/articleshow/134883270.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T10:40:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134883286,imgsize-973818.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Beyoncé expands beauty scholarships to the UK with $250,000 for 10 schools]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134882678.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/beyoncs-beauty-brand-is-expanding-its-scholarship-fund-to-the-uk-10-schools-will-receive-250000-to-train-the-next-generation-of-hair-professionals/articleshow/134882678.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/beyoncs-beauty-brand-is-expanding-its-scholarship-fund-to-the-uk-10-schools-will-receive-250000-to-train-the-next-generation-of-hair-professionals/articleshow/134882678.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T10:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134882802,imgsize-449669.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Hundreds of thousands of abandoned US mines now shelter bats and snakes after mining booms]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134867645.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The transformation of former mining sites into sanctuaries for bats and diverse wildlife plays a critical role in ecological conservation. Bat Conservation International works closely with various agencies to ensure these habitats flourish while prioritizing public safety. By installing specialized bat gates, they effectively control human access, allowing the ecosystems to thrive. Detailed surveys evaluate these sites' conditions, establishing a national inventory to support risk management and ecological restoration efforts.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/hundreds-of-thousands-of-abandoned-us-mines-were-left-behind-after-mining-booms-bats-snakes-and-bobcats-now-use-them-as-refuges/articleshow/134867645.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/hundreds-of-thousands-of-abandoned-us-mines-were-left-behind-after-mining-booms-bats-snakes-and-bobcats-now-use-them-as-refuges/articleshow/134867645.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T00:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134867750,imgsize-93197.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Thousands of rare grasshoppers released in Norfolk after 86 years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134867786.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[After a long absence, the large marsh grasshopper has been reintroduced to Norfolk's Broads region. The successful conservation effort involved raising grasshoppers and releasing them into restored wetland areas. Following 86 years of population decline, the grasshoppers have hatched for the first time since 1939. The project received significant funding and support from various conservation partners and volunteers.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/thousands-of-rare-grasshoppers-released-in-norfolk-after-86-years-conservation-project-achieves-first-wild-hatching-since-1939/articleshow/134867786.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/thousands-of-rare-grasshoppers-released-in-norfolk-after-86-years-conservation-project-achieves-first-wild-hatching-since-1939/articleshow/134867786.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T04:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134867851,imgsize-88178.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Buckingham Palace workers find theatre listings, newspaper pages, and a sixpence ticket]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134871105.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[During the refurbishment of Buckingham Palace, various historical objects were discovered hidden under the floorboards. These items included hobnailed boots, betting slips, and newspaper fragments dating back to the 19th century. Additionally, a typed document concerning Queen Elizabeth II's diplomatic reception from 1977 was recovered. The restoration aims to update the palace's electrical systems and lead pipes, some of which are over sixty years old.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/buckingham-palace-workers-find-137-year-old-theatre-listings-1966-newspaper-pages-and-a-sixpence-ticket-to-a-1949-palace-card-game/articleshow/134871105.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/buckingham-palace-workers-find-137-year-old-theatre-listings-1966-newspaper-pages-and-a-sixpence-ticket-to-a-1949-palace-card-game/articleshow/134871105.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T08:15:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134871223,imgsize-74161.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[UK engineers build tiny pump that could let robots move without bulky motors]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134881057.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/uk-engineers-built-a-tiny-liquid-metal-pump-to-move-robotic-butterfly-wings-and-power-wearable-devi